@startuml quote-flow
!include _theme.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title Quote
caption GET /api/v1/quote. Local math over Redis. Never RPC. Numbers match the Architecture page.

actor Client
participant "api-server" as API
participant "PathFinder" as PF
database Redis
participant "QuoteEngine" as QE
participant "SplitOptimizer" as SO

Client -> API : 1. GET /api/v1/quote
API -> API : 2. load snapshot engine
API -> PF : 3. find_candidate_paths
PF --> API : candidate paths\n(no liquidity prune)
API -> Redis : 4. MGET pool keys\nxyk · stable · clmm
Redis --> API : cached pool state
API -> QE : 5. quote each path at amount_in
QE --> API : QuotedPath list
API -> SO : 6. split if impact or\ncompetitive delta warrants it
SO --> API : OptimalRoute
API --> Client : 7. expected_output · min_out · sub_routes

@enduml
